{"4657860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GranEndeSaga", "steam_appid": 4657860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657860/extras/e8876dae43e4b6823d2ed4cfaaa16fd6.avif?t=1785502234\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In an abandoned shrine deep in the mountains, a man suddenly and mysteriously appears before Ellone, a nun, and Steen, a knight. With no memory of his past or identity, he is adrift in the world. However, a single command drives him: Find Neo, the hero who saved the world from calamity ten years prior. But it seems Neo has been dead for some time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657860/extras/15abc6acfb1d5a2846cf8d3614e3c256.avif?t=1785502234\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through a traditional turn-based RPG as you seek out your past! Spend time with your companions to grow closer with them as you adventure, and become a licensed adventurer to take on side quests as you continue on your journey. Explore abandoned ruins, monster-ridden marshes, and stop the White Dragon Cult's plans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657860/extras/fd47b24ecdb42bd59656d6d9fa42df0c.avif?t=1785502234\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657860/extras/6b3730b28dadf89c29826c5364f057eb.avif?t=1785502234\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657860/extras/4c8feeb1923bcae0e65dfdfa6b24e977.avif?t=1785502234\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657860/extras/565f517ae0a802f31c17a20bb9b2abdb.avif?t=1785502234\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657860/extras/97d04d64fd4990d8593646cacf987d6c.avif?t=1785502234\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657860/extras/91f74f48de3d8fe4d50d69c8066a73ce.avif?t=1785502234\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Buy Your Skills!</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Skill Coins to purchase rare and powerful abilities as you travel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Monster Hunting!</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform Area Subjugation, culling monsters from regions to keep them safe and earn rewards from the Adventurers' Guild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Hustle Away!</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on side quests from the Adventurers' Guild to raise funds for your travels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Super Effective Staggering!</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A smart use of status effects can stagger the enemy! Burn plant monsters, blind enemies with large eyes, or silence enemies with a big mouth to make your battles easier! </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657860/extras/e8876dae43e4b6823d2ed4cfaaa16fd6.avif?t=1785502234\" width=616 he